wrong, what do we do,

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:03.170
we always throw internal
server error 500.

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:04.390
It doesn't matter what it is.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.730
Just a 500 is absolutely OK.

00:21:06.730 --> 00:21:08.890
And then you can actually
