00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:45.580
And what we can do is implement
this location functionality

00:21:45.580 --> 00:21:47.470
that comes with Ktor.

00:21:47.470 --> 00:21:50.350
Which basically I can say
to search for location

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:52.360
