going to do is instead

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:01.300
of using this format
of PUT, I'm going

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:05.830
to use a generic type
of PUT, which is mono.

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:08.650
So that's going to import
the correct mono, which

00:22:08.650 --> 00:22:09.800
is location.

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.970
And then instead of using
core parameters, what I can do

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:15.910
is actually, this
is a lambda, so I

00:22:15.910 --> 00:22:19.820
can pass the strongly typed
parameter to my function.

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:23.090
Which is all of the parameters
that are part of the route.

00:22:23.090 --> 00:22:25.960
